desloppify-ts
https://github.com/cstarlea/desloppify

desloppify-ts is a modified fork of desloppify by Peter O'Malley
(https://github.com/peteromallet/desloppify), distributed under the Open
Source Native License (OSNL) 0.2. The full license is in LICENSE.

Copyright (c) 2025-2026 Peter O'Malley.

Changes in this fork: the fork narrows desloppify to TypeScript and
JavaScript, removes the other language plugins, and changes detectors,
fixers, scoring, packaging and documentation throughout. The last
multi-language version is tagged `pre-ts-only`; `git log pre-ts-only..`
lists every change made since. Files under `desloppify/` and `docs/` may
have been modified by the fork.

Upstream contributions
----------------------

desloppify was written by Peter O'Malley with contributions from the
upstream community; `git log pre-ts-only` records every upstream author.

These upstream pull requests were merged into the fork after upstream
stopped merging changes. Some covered languages the fork has since dropped;
their authors are credited all the same.

